--- !u!1 &688561331
GameObject:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 688561334}
  - component: {fileID: 688561333}
  - component: {fileID: 688561332}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: Dialogue_Beat4_Ultimatum
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &688561332
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 688561331}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Drone
    text: Message incoming. Priority override. I couldn't refuse it.
    seconds: 3.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8222084858bf2dd44b3a951061c6b68e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: ...Of course you couldn't.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35e69aaa3ff4bcd40ae366b46ecb129d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Handler (Hologram)
    text: Kessler.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d08436fa0b4e57b479e599aaae17a72f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Handler (Hologram)
    text: The Dominion has a long memory for the men who once served it. Longer than
      yours, it seems. You've let yourself forget the arrangement. I haven't.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be04c7dc876e6ff4ca2fd677543bfb49, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I paid out of that. Years ago.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c069003d5f96ba4c91ba293f5f54d8e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Handler (Hologram)
    text: No one pays out of it. You hold something of ours. We watched you use it
      tonight, messily, but effectively. You will return it, intact, within three
      days.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95b0073dfc7b67f44b736b17f439516b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Handler (Hologram)
    text: Three days, Kessler. You know the markets at Velorum. We have taken your
      daughter there. Deliver the item, or you will never see your daughter.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7f0d09d46a7c07478576843fd78d380, type: 3}
  - speaker: Handler (Hologram)
    text: Iris. She's grown, since you saw her. We've kept the asset in good condition.
      Whether we continue to is a matter of your arithmetic.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92b9b9ecef75ee249979d3dcf8b4b275, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Iris?
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8af30e0b2c9db74fb5c0ce60b56c318, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: My daughter. They took her to make sure I stayed useful. She was in a Dominion
      school, but they probably took her in Velorum's markets, where they sell bodies
      and pasts and call it commerce. Six years I've scraped this dead field for
      enough to buy her back, before they remembered they could just use her on me
      again. And tonight they remembered.
    seconds: 25
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e48fa959f739ab94abfee9cf7f57bb74, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: That's the debt you meant. Not the one to me.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f814d01b008c5a043857ffbee4d448d9, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: At the start. Maybe. Before there was a man behind the eyes.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d033160699e338d4f950f8255797641f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then it's simple. You give them what they came for. Me.
    seconds: 4.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e8fbfab2edd3a644b3694177927d887, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: No.
    seconds: 0.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e392937c1fc856f4bbd2ca43121a44d8, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: My life for hers. A clean trade. I don't remember being a man worth keeping,
      Kessler. I don't remember the mercy you owe me for. But this I can do.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bef502f2177e4b6478dcad31aa615609, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: It's a bluff.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 513d3b6b8887f2e458a9ff5762d14416, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You think men like that trade? They don't trade. They collect. You walk
      into Velorum and hand yourself over, and they don't open her cage and wave
      goodbye. They put you in a box, again, and they put her in the ground next
      to it, and they file it tidy.
    seconds: 19
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: abe58f40d38ab1642925d0c50164c969, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You can't know that.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b19511ae3985b7e41a12b42b373ae1e0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I served them. I know exactly what their mercy is worth. I've run that
      math every night for six years.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85e95ae83d21c9a43811224840818811, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then we don't trade.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 019c5cddc029fc44f97d35cb58e111d7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: No. I didn't pull you out of a coffin to ship you back to one. We go to
      Velorum, and we take her back, and we make them eat the difference.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8b65d7381896074cafe7cbfd97e249c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Three days.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b6436da95a3e43468133a5eb4d49658, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Three days. Velorum's a long burn and a worse welcome. They sell bodies
      and pasts in those markets. Maybe somebody there sold yours.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a50629c6a5ceeb94e90305511bbe8f86, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I spared a man I don't remember. I want to know why I went easy.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dee36c80f69747e4ea9cbdd9e55c53b4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Then we ask Velorum.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 861df7e02d9f25b4eb5c8c4553682276, type: 3}
  - speaker: Drone
    text: Heading laid. Velorum.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4430fb6e30b7a3e48b6fb58e91d72302, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Take us out.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48bd46ad71a59714d92bb977640f6a54, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1090388491}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1325880635}
  audioSource: {fileID: 688561333}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
